<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?><Content Author="Frictional Dogs" Dependencies="" Description_english="Henri was just about to escape the Bunker, the Beast just behind him. But suddenly, he is transported to another reality! He feels lighter, more.. athletic. Could he have gained new abilities? &#10;&#10;Hopefully, the Beast hasn't followed him. And hopefully he didn't gain new abilities as well...&#10;&#10;Try to find your way home from this city of glass.&#10;&#10;=======================&#10;&#10;This mod was created during the Frictional Games 2026 Modding Jam under the theme: What is reality? And as an homage to Mirror's Edge.&#10;&#10;=======================&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: Some of the mod programming was created with the assistance of Ai coding tools. " Description_spanish="Esto es una plantilla base para crear mapas personalizados." HotLoad="false" InitCfg="config/main_init.cfg" LauncherPic="LauncherPic.png" Title="Bunker's Edge" Type="StandAlone" UID="" Version="1.0"/>